            text: '(Wounded villagers lie on the pews. Kuma listens, hands trembling.) "He came back \u2014 sixteen years after the Freedom Fighters drove him out, and this time with fire." (He pulls off his gloves.) "I am a pacifist by nature. But enough. Go to Castle Town and clear the way. I will follow."',
