          text: `"At night his zombies drag you to the Mast Mansion. Moria snips your shadow away with giant scissors and Dr. Hogback stuffs it into a corpse \u2014 a zombie with your personality. Salt in a zombie's mouth sets the shadow free. Take some. Beat the Mysterious Four: Hogback, Absalom, Perona... and Moria."`,
