            text: () => ['"The Tower, reversed. A great house will fall on an island of flowers. You will be standing close enough to feel the dust."', `"Death \u2014 which only means change. You will hold a red stone's words in your hands before the year ends. Zero percent chance you understand them."`, '"The Emperor. An old woman who is also a nation. She will offer you tea. Probability you survive refusing: two percent."'][Math.floor(Math.random() * 3)],
