        text: () => done5(ctx, "nw_birdcage") ? '"My name is Viola. My father is King Riku. For ten years I danced for the man who stole our country, to keep my family alive. Now I can use my own name again."' : `"(A flamenco dancer watches the door with unusual eyes.) I can see a great distance, stranger \u2014 through walls, into hearts. Yours isn't the heart of a Donquixote. So I will tell you: the Toy House hides a door. Remember it."`
