        pitch: `"A Vegapunk on your crew? Heh \u2014 I'm the evil one, you know. ...The doctor deciphered the ancient script from the books of Ohara, and I remember everything he knew. If you're heading for Laugh Tale you'll need someone who can read the Road Poneglyphs. I'm in!"`
