        text: `"GEGYAGYAGYA! A little warrior in the Hall of Warriors! I am Hajrudin. I once dreamed of being King of Elbaph \u2014 then a man in a straw hat knocked me flat. So I became a pirate instead. Want to learn how giants fight?"`,
